WEBVTT

01:59.270 --> 02:01.010
Today's practice is over!

02:21.310 --> 02:23.700
Listen up everyone.

02:24.060 --> 02:27.670
I've decided we're going to participate in a training camp.

02:27.670 --> 02:29.420
What?!

02:29.420 --> 02:31.630
But I already had plans!

02:31.630 --> 02:33.580
Why now of all times?

02:33.580 --> 02:35.710
Because...

02:35.710 --> 02:37.840
So big, so big!

02:36.740 --> 02:37.840
Um...

02:37.840 --> 02:38.950
Please...

02:38.950 --> 02:41.030
Stop...

02:41.030 --> 02:42.970
Because...

02:43.780 --> 02:48.630
We have too many people with different personalities, and we fail to work well with each other!

02:48.630 --> 02:49.310
That's why...

02:49.810 --> 02:55.760
That's why we're going on a training camp, to strengthen our team work!

02:56.900 --> 03:01.950
Even though swimming is an individual sport, it's very important for our feelings to be in unison...

03:04.140 --> 03:06.580
Well, you're right.

03:06.580 --> 03:08.410
Tell that to the boys downstairs.

03:09.360 --> 03:11.360
We got it.

03:32.940 --> 03:34.900
It's so spacious!

03:35.650 --> 03:37.490
A tatami, a tatami!

03:36.420 --> 03:39.530
So our school had a room like this, huh?

03:39.700 --> 03:44.470
Yes, this is the traditional training camp site

03:44.470 --> 03:48.740
for many Umisho athletic clubs, and is the birthplace of many legends!

03:49.070 --> 03:54.340
Now everyone, let us create another legend together!

03:54.340 --> 03:56.380
The boys are downstairs in the night-duty room!

04:01.780 --> 04:03.050
Excuse me.

04:03.400 --> 04:05.810
Please let us use this place again.

04:05.810 --> 04:08.060
You got kicked out by the girls again, huh?

04:08.410 --> 04:14.890
Well, I'm okay with it as long as you bring me stuff like this.

04:16.460 --> 04:18.820
I wonder if this is a tradition as well.

04:18.820 --> 04:22.320
Now, let's put our things down and get started.

04:22.600 --> 04:25.190
Listen up, our theme here is "The Ability To Work Well With Others."

04:25.190 --> 04:27.500
The tatami feels so good.

04:27.500 --> 04:28.500
Hey!

04:28.500 --> 04:29.870
What did I just say?!

04:30.660 --> 04:33.210
Hey, listen to what I have to say!

04:33.560 --> 04:36.080
This is my first time at a training camp.

04:36.080 --> 04:38.080
I'm getting nervous.

04:38.080 --> 04:41.920
You experienced this last year, right, Shizuoka-senpai?

04:42.280 --> 04:47.200
U-Unfortunately, I haven't experienced it yet.

04:47.200 --> 04:52.750
But, I am interested.

04:53.180 --> 04:55.020
There!

04:55.020 --> 04:56.540
This is easy...

04:56.540 --> 04:57.560
Yeah, isn't it?

04:56.940 --> 04:57.560
Oops!

05:03.090 --> 05:04.640
Water girl!

05:04.640 --> 05:05.450
Just kidding.

05:06.490 --> 05:08.220
You want to swim with me?

05:08.220 --> 05:09.700
L-Like I said...

05:09.920 --> 05:11.740
Yes, this is it!

05:12.090 --> 05:15.890
Our swimming team will have no tomorrow if we don't do something about this!

05:18.750 --> 05:19.490
You two!

05:19.490 --> 05:20.590
Stop playing around!

05:20.840 --> 05:22.920
Makio-chan, stop touching her breasts!

05:23.320 --> 05:25.130
Tsutsumi, what are you doing?!

05:26.630 --> 05:29.640
All right, intervals are over!

05:28.570 --> 05:29.640
Me too?

05:30.630 --> 05:32.560
Ok, your life is over!

05:32.890 --> 05:34.220
Scary...

05:34.220 --> 05:36.060
Senpai is merciless today.

05:36.410 --> 05:39.940
Geez, every single one of you is hopeless.

05:39.940 --> 05:42.020
Now, now, don't get so worked up.

05:42.370 --> 05:45.070
It's a rare training camp, you know.

05:45.350 --> 05:46.710
Hey!

05:46.710 --> 05:50.010
Oh, the mushroom is cooked nicely.

05:50.010 --> 05:51.240
Isn't it tasty?

05:52.140 --> 05:53.730
The blazing sun.

05:53.730 --> 05:55.080
A waterfront barbecue.

05:55.430 --> 05:56.370
It's summer.

05:56.930 --> 05:58.670
There's no time for this!

05:59.970 --> 06:00.990
Hey you!

06:00.990 --> 06:02.500
Don't get out yet!

06:02.500 --> 06:04.610
Himekawa, you get in, too!

06:04.610 --> 06:06.270
U-Um, yes.

06:06.270 --> 06:08.810
Okiura, check everyone's form!

06:08.810 --> 06:10.530
Y-Yes!

06:11.680 --> 06:16.950
All right, no one's getting out for another hour!

06:18.370 --> 06:20.660
Is Senpai wobbling around?

06:21.210 --> 06:22.690
This is...

06:23.480 --> 06:25.650
Is there a problem with that mushroom?

06:26.690 --> 06:32.200
This is the legendary poisonous mushroom that grows on Ono Island every 30 years.

06:32.490 --> 06:34.590
Satsumaotokodake is the name.

06:34.590 --> 06:36.340
A poisonous mushroom?!

06:36.340 --> 06:38.730
What happens if you eat it?

06:38.730 --> 06:40.870
You turn into that.

06:40.870 --> 06:42.210
Hey, you!

06:42.970 --> 06:45.770
Geez...

06:47.210 --> 06:50.150
S-Senpai, are you okay?

06:50.150 --> 06:52.300
What?

06:52.300 --> 06:57.380
You have a problem with me?

07:03.750 --> 07:07.030
I'm feeling kinda hot.

07:07.430 --> 07:10.350
Hey, Senpai, why are stripping?!

07:11.480 --> 07:14.750
Are you saying I can't strip?

07:14.750 --> 07:17.250
Why?!

07:17.250 --> 07:21.580
U-Um, we're in the middle of practice, and there are lots of people here.

07:21.930 --> 07:27.260
Is my body not appealing?

07:27.260 --> 07:28.080
Huh?

07:29.950 --> 07:32.220
T-That's not it...

07:32.220 --> 07:37.000
Are you saying that I'm not as appealing as Shizuoka or Amuro?

07:37.000 --> 07:40.850
I'm pretty hot you know!

07:40.850 --> 07:43.460
Why are you picking a fight with me?!

07:43.460 --> 07:45.110
Fine.

07:45.110 --> 07:46.310
Then, everyone...

07:46.740 --> 07:50.150
I'll show you...

07:50.680 --> 07:53.020
my appeal!

07:56.660 --> 07:58.160
Hey!

07:59.380 --> 08:01.160
Great, great!

08:03.800 --> 08:06.420
Captain, stop watching and stop her!

08:07.530 --> 08:09.810
Bravo, Momoko!

08:09.810 --> 08:11.920
I'll go along with you!

08:13.650 --> 08:15.430
What is the meaning of this?!

08:18.370 --> 08:20.260
Then, me too!

08:20.260 --> 08:21.430
Don't!

08:23.940 --> 08:25.660
Fly!

08:26.270 --> 08:30.030
Why is there a poisonous mushroom here?

08:30.140 --> 08:32.250
My dad got it!

08:32.250 --> 08:34.920
There are plenty more at my house.

08:42.310 --> 08:46.230
I don't remember anything from today.

08:46.230 --> 08:47.790
Did something happen?

08:47.790 --> 08:48.920
N-No!

08:48.920 --> 08:49.870
Nothing at all!

08:49.870 --> 08:52.460
Yeah, you just practiced too much.

08:52.930 --> 08:55.430
It sure was tiring today.

08:55.430 --> 08:58.240
But aren't you glad we got to swim so much?

08:58.240 --> 09:00.560
Don't take too much time.

09:00.560 --> 09:02.560
The boys are coming in after us.

09:02.560 --> 09:03.940
Ok!

09:03.940 --> 09:07.480
But your chest is so big, Amuro-senpai.

09:08.060 --> 09:14.490
If Makio had a nice body, I wonder what kind of elegant lifestyle would have awaited me.

09:14.790 --> 09:19.490
Hey, Amuro-senpai, how did you get it to be so big?

09:20.210 --> 09:22.490
I don't really have a secret.

09:23.300 --> 09:24.450
Sounds stupid.

09:24.870 --> 09:28.780
Probably because my dad and my little brothers fondle them so much.

09:33.760 --> 09:36.700
Oh, you have siblings...

09:36.700 --> 09:38.530
Yep, in Okinawa.

09:38.530 --> 09:40.940
3 little brothers and 2 little sisters.

09:41.780 --> 09:43.970
I don't know about her dad doing that...

09:45.020 --> 09:47.650
All right, let's get out soon.

09:47.650 --> 09:48.980
Ok!

09:52.850 --> 09:53.740
Kan.

09:56.610 --> 09:57.740
Ron.

09:59.180 --> 10:02.960
Why do you have to do that after I looked so cool?!

10:02.960 --> 10:04.740
W-Well, this <i>is</i> a match.

10:05.610 --> 10:06.860
Boys.

10:06.860 --> 10:08.520
You guys can use the bath now.

10:08.520 --> 10:09.620
Oh, okay.

10:10.530 --> 10:13.670
Since we finished just now, how about we hit the shower?

10:14.050 --> 10:17.970
Why do I, the oldest person here, get last place?

10:17.970 --> 10:19.340
Now, now.

10:20.620 --> 10:21.890
Come to think of it, where's Takeda?

10:22.940 --> 10:25.660
He said that he was going to buy something a while ago.

10:25.660 --> 10:26.970
Buy something?

10:32.390 --> 10:37.900
I'll pick up the rare mushrooms from Ninagawa's place, now that I've bought some stuff.

10:39.340 --> 10:41.030
That was refreshing.

10:43.010 --> 10:46.500
Shizuoka-senpai, you didn't take a bath?

10:46.500 --> 10:49.620
Um, no, I don't need to take one.

10:52.560 --> 10:53.630
Um...

10:56.800 --> 11:04.430
Um, do you also get your chest fondled by many people?

11:04.430 --> 11:06.640
Like by parents or siblings?

11:07.330 --> 11:08.800
N-No.

11:08.800 --> 11:10.430
Um...

11:11.550 --> 11:13.910
Let's fondle each other.

11:13.910 --> 11:16.280
Please stop.

11:16.280 --> 11:17.940
Get bigger.

11:19.420 --> 11:27.410
Shizuoka-senpai's chest is going to grow, thanks to Amuro-senpai.

11:30.380 --> 11:32.690
Looks like we're out of drinks.

11:33.110 --> 11:34.830
I'll go get something.

11:35.190 --> 11:39.340
Then pick out some snacks at the convenience store while you're at it.

11:39.760 --> 11:42.390
If you want that, you have to pay for yourself.

11:42.390 --> 11:44.840
We don't have any more of the club budget left.

11:45.200 --> 11:46.550
Yes, yes!

11:46.550 --> 11:48.850
I have a lot of snacks at my house!

11:49.200 --> 11:51.560
The ones I brought from Okinawa!

11:51.560 --> 11:53.290
I have drinks, too.

11:53.290 --> 11:54.680
Sounds good.

11:54.680 --> 11:56.240
Like tea scones?

11:56.240 --> 11:57.910
Citrus frescas?

11:57.910 --> 11:59.360
You mean citrus depressas.

11:59.710 --> 12:02.240
I'll run out and get it!

12:02.240 --> 12:03.360
Makio will go as well.

12:03.720 --> 12:05.110
Wait a minute.

12:05.110 --> 12:07.560
Everyone, say what you want.

12:08.780 --> 12:10.870
Now's the chance.

12:14.380 --> 12:19.210
I don't like having people look at me in my underwear...

12:20.280 --> 12:22.360
even if they're girls.

12:25.690 --> 12:29.470
That's why I have to go in by myself.

12:34.270 --> 12:37.400
This is pretty nice when you're by yourself.

12:38.650 --> 12:42.360
Come to think of it, the boys were in here as well.

12:43.810 --> 12:46.890
Now that I think about it...

12:47.900 --> 12:52.230
Geez, don't you guys feel like letting a senpai win?

12:52.230 --> 12:54.330
You're still saying that?

12:54.330 --> 12:55.830
It <i>is</i> a match.

12:57.480 --> 12:59.380
They haven't bathed yet?!

13:00.470 --> 13:04.250
Why are the boys here now?!

13:19.230 --> 13:22.690
You didn't have to come, Orizuka-senpai.

13:22.690 --> 13:26.860
I should at least go say hi as a supervisor,

13:26.860 --> 13:30.730
since we're going be getting some food and drinks at this hour.

13:34.330 --> 13:35.120
Rain?

13:46.060 --> 13:48.890
This place is just too big.

13:48.890 --> 13:51.800
The girls were in here a few minutes ago, right?

13:52.730 --> 13:55.000
W-What should I do?

13:56.460 --> 13:57.880
What should I do?

13:58.350 --> 14:00.210
If they see me,

14:01.100 --> 14:02.770
I get to...

14:02.770 --> 14:03.940
see them naked,

14:04.640 --> 14:06.150
but they'll see me.

14:13.640 --> 14:17.600
Orizuka-senpai sure was great today.

14:17.600 --> 14:19.160
Yeah, you're right.

14:19.520 --> 14:23.080
Orizuka-senpai has that nice tight body.

14:23.080 --> 14:25.620
If she did something like that, I could just die.

14:26.810 --> 14:28.170
You guys sure are young.

14:29.830 --> 14:32.760
So this is what guys talk about with other guys.

14:32.760 --> 14:35.570
But, Shizoka-senpai is nice as well.

14:36.700 --> 14:37.560
Yeah.

14:37.560 --> 14:40.690
I know it's bad, but I still look at her out of the corner of my eye.

14:41.090 --> 14:42.840
Y-Yeah.

14:43.830 --> 14:45.190
All of you are young.

14:47.130 --> 14:48.260
Phew.

14:49.010 --> 14:52.550
Don't go into the bath until you finish washing yourself.

14:52.550 --> 14:54.780
But it's annoying.

14:54.780 --> 14:56.650
We're last anyways.

14:56.650 --> 14:58.300
Kaname is right!

14:58.300 --> 14:59.960
Go in after you've washed yourself properly.

15:00.270 --> 15:01.280
If you don't,

15:01.280 --> 15:03.960
then be baptized by my dangling thing!

15:05.570 --> 15:06.770
C-Captain!

15:07.860 --> 15:09.900
A baptism by his dangling thing...

15:09.900 --> 15:11.190
I wonder what that is.

15:12.650 --> 15:16.930
B-But, I might be able to escape right now.

15:16.930 --> 15:17.480
Captain!

15:17.480 --> 15:18.790
It's lukewarm.

15:20.140 --> 15:22.090
Don't get me involved!

15:22.090 --> 15:23.050
There.

15:28.080 --> 15:29.320
How's this?

15:29.320 --> 15:29.890
There.

15:29.890 --> 15:30.720
Please let me go!

15:30.720 --> 15:31.820
Don't get me involved!

15:32.380 --> 15:34.660
What's with this wash bowl?

15:37.470 --> 15:38.660
Who is it?

15:42.140 --> 15:43.210
Is it a power outage?!

15:43.210 --> 15:45.180
Looks like lightning struck.

15:46.830 --> 15:47.820
Senpai?

15:47.820 --> 15:48.960
Okiura-senpai.

15:48.960 --> 15:50.050
What's wrong, Kaname?!

15:50.050 --> 15:51.170
Get a hold of yourself!

15:56.720 --> 15:58.680
Are you okay, senpai?

15:58.680 --> 16:00.530
He must have slipped and fell.

16:00.530 --> 16:01.660
Hit the lights!

16:01.660 --> 16:03.550
It's a power outage.

16:03.550 --> 16:05.460
I'm sorry, Okiura-kun.

16:05.460 --> 16:06.550
I'm sorry.

16:13.780 --> 16:14.760
Hurry!

16:14.760 --> 16:16.450
Into my house!

16:17.510 --> 16:18.560
Wait!

16:18.560 --> 16:20.380
Wait for me!

16:21.900 --> 16:23.460
Ow.

16:24.940 --> 16:26.460
No way.

16:27.410 --> 16:30.910
Geez, even my bra is wet.

16:30.910 --> 16:33.970
Is your dad not home, Amuro-senpai?

16:33.970 --> 16:36.660
I think he went out for some fishing at night.

16:36.660 --> 16:39.220
He's probably avoiding the rain at some fishing ground.

16:40.510 --> 16:43.090
Boats sure do shake.

16:47.100 --> 16:49.110
Where's Chigusa-chan?

16:51.300 --> 16:54.110
Hey, what are you doing?

16:54.110 --> 16:55.030
Are you okay...?

16:55.380 --> 16:55.780
Huh?

17:07.110 --> 17:09.900
Where's the land?!

17:12.240 --> 17:13.750
It's back.

17:16.960 --> 17:19.980
I wonder if Orizuka-senpai and the others are alright.

17:19.980 --> 17:23.670
I think I heard that there was a typhoon coming in.

17:26.230 --> 17:28.000
But, thank goodness.

17:28.000 --> 17:31.150
If it wasn't for the power outage, right now...

17:33.750 --> 17:35.460
Something feels odd.

17:37.730 --> 17:40.160
There was someone here besides us?

17:41.440 --> 17:42.460
No way!

17:42.460 --> 17:44.310
It's true!

17:44.310 --> 17:48.170
I saw a plump, white skin for a second.

17:52.370 --> 17:54.030
Could this be...

17:54.700 --> 17:58.680
Could it be that she was here?!

18:00.630 --> 18:01.670
Ikamasa-kun.

18:01.670 --> 18:02.640
Ikamasa-kun, are you here?

18:03.960 --> 18:04.850
What's wrong?!

18:05.300 --> 18:06.440
We got a problem.

18:06.440 --> 18:08.600
I just got a call from Chigusa.

18:08.600 --> 18:09.390
Ninagawa-san's house...

18:16.580 --> 18:18.050
What the hell!

18:18.050 --> 18:19.640
What's going on?!

18:19.640 --> 18:22.840
Looks like we got swept away after the stakes came out.

18:22.840 --> 18:24.030
It happens sometimes.

18:24.390 --> 18:27.160
How can you be so carefree?!

18:35.390 --> 18:37.380
We're gonna die!

18:43.100 --> 18:44.390
Amuro!

18:44.720 --> 18:48.360
Right now, our friends are facing danger.

18:48.360 --> 18:53.180
We are worried about our friends' safety, and we are running under the storm with our feelings in unison.

18:53.180 --> 18:55.400
What a great example of cooperation.

18:55.760 --> 18:59.790
This will be our final objective for our training camp!

18:59.790 --> 19:02.200
There's no time to be saying that!

19:04.930 --> 19:05.980
Is it here?!

19:05.980 --> 19:07.190
There's no doubt about it!

19:07.190 --> 19:08.320
The stakes are there!

19:08.320 --> 19:09.120
You're right.

19:12.430 --> 19:14.670
Not a single trace of it left.

19:14.670 --> 19:16.400
Senpai!

19:17.650 --> 19:20.330
All right, we'll head back with Chigusa.

19:22.360 --> 19:23.770
There's nothing to worry about.

19:23.770 --> 19:28.000
After the typhoon passes, and the waves quiet down, they'll be able to swim back.

19:31.300 --> 19:32.600
This is...

19:33.370 --> 19:34.730
That shoe...

19:34.730 --> 19:36.110
I think...

19:43.180 --> 19:45.760
What time is it now?

19:45.760 --> 19:49.250
Everything was blown away.

19:50.760 --> 19:53.540
To be drifting in this outfit...

19:53.670 --> 19:56.210
I'm thirsty.

19:56.200 --> 19:58.210
Yeah, me too.

19:58.210 --> 20:00.880
Since we did get washed away...

20:00.880 --> 20:03.250
Are you okay, Ninagawa-san?

20:03.250 --> 20:04.950
I'm used to it.

20:05.790 --> 20:08.450
I'm hungry.

20:08.450 --> 20:10.850
I have mushrooms left over.

20:10.850 --> 20:12.980
Isn't that the poisonous mushroom?

20:13.390 --> 20:15.590
It tastes good though.

20:17.940 --> 20:22.530
We won't be able to eat anything unless we get some water soon.

20:22.950 --> 20:25.930
I have drinks right here.

20:27.040 --> 20:28.920
T-Takeda!

20:28.920 --> 20:30.850
Why are you here?

20:30.850 --> 20:33.640
I was out to get some drinks.

20:33.640 --> 20:34.370
Drinks.

20:34.370 --> 20:35.540
Food.

20:35.540 --> 20:39.640
Why are you at Amuro-senpai's house when you went to buy stuff?

20:39.640 --> 20:42.550
I don't really understand, but you saved us.

20:42.970 --> 20:44.890
Give them to us.

20:45.630 --> 20:48.590
G-Git nekkid...

20:50.420 --> 20:52.890
You're being rude.

20:53.810 --> 20:55.700
What's with that attitude?

20:55.700 --> 20:57.210
Why are you being so pretentious?!

20:57.210 --> 20:58.990
Think about the situation we're in.

20:58.990 --> 21:02.900
This is all the food and drinks we have.

21:03.340 --> 21:07.660
I'll feed you guys treats for listening to my orders.

21:08.560 --> 21:10.430
This must be revenge for that other stuff.

21:10.430 --> 21:12.020
He's awful.

21:12.020 --> 21:13.820
Let's get some treats.

21:13.820 --> 21:19.170
Now, one at a time, act sexy and beg like a little kitty.

21:20.730 --> 21:22.890
We have to endure it, here.

21:25.080 --> 21:26.130
All right.

21:28.130 --> 21:31.980
Can I have some drinks?

21:31.980 --> 21:33.140
Nyaa!

21:35.160 --> 21:37.320
You're feeling embarrassed.

21:37.320 --> 21:38.780
And it feels like you're an old lady.

21:38.780 --> 21:39.750
You fail.

21:40.680 --> 21:42.440
Endure it, Senpai!

21:42.440 --> 21:43.910
Let Makio handle it.

21:44.480 --> 21:47.150
My throat is completely dry, nyaa.

21:47.970 --> 21:49.530
No sex appeal at all.

21:49.530 --> 21:50.910
You fail.

21:57.080 --> 21:59.600
This upward glance, the way she walks...

21:59.600 --> 22:01.630
She's not saying "nyaa," but "naa."

22:01.630 --> 22:03.670
T-This is it.

22:03.670 --> 22:06.170
Gao!

22:23.490 --> 22:25.030
The food...

22:27.180 --> 22:31.510
Geez, what did you do that for?

22:33.960 --> 22:36.080
I thought I was going to drown.

22:36.330 --> 22:38.470
Hey, Takeda.

22:39.160 --> 22:41.810
If you hadn't done that,

22:41.810 --> 22:44.280
this wouldn't have...

22:44.280 --> 22:45.930
The drinks...

22:45.930 --> 22:47.290
The food...

22:54.300 --> 22:55.310
What's that?

22:58.520 --> 23:02.620
So with Takeda's screaming voice, they were noticed by a boat passing by,

23:02.620 --> 23:04.120
and it ended without any real trouble.

23:04.890 --> 23:06.770
Our house was washed away?

23:06.770 --> 23:09.190
Yeah, it happens sometimes.

23:09.190 --> 23:11.570
How can you be so carefree?

23:11.570 --> 23:13.370
He's so mature.

24:45.790 --> 24:49.740
Yo, I'm the Umisho swimming team's captain, Ikariya Masa.

24:49.740 --> 24:51.510
Also known as Ikamasa!

24:51.510 --> 24:55.440
I used to play at the rocks of Ono Island, too.

24:55.440 --> 24:56.930
It sure was fun.

24:56.930 --> 25:01.230
There were a bunch of rocks that looked like icicles.

25:01.230 --> 25:02.600
But when you get stabbed by them, it hurt.

25:02.950 --> 25:04.600
It prickly, you know.

25:05.970 --> 25:07.020
Now!

25:07.020 --> 25:09.360
Next time on Kenkou Zenrakei Suieibu Umisho:

25:10.330 --> 25:13.070
"Do you want mine, too?"

25:13.070 --> 25:14.270
Look forward to it!
